WEBVTT

00:12.970 --> 00:18.710
Hikari ga sasu sora, umareochiru kage
In the bright sky illuminated by
sunlight, darkened shadows are born.

00:18.810 --> 00:24.150
Unmei wa dokomademo hikisakareru
Fate itself is being torn apart.

00:25.190 --> 00:30.150
Donna toki mo kesshite akiramenainara
If you never give up, no matter what happens,

00:30.330 --> 00:37.560
mada tozasareteru tobira kanarazu hiraku
Even that locked door will open for you.

00:38.530 --> 00:43.990
Eien datte dakishimete, fuuin mo tokihanachi
Embrace eternity and release the seal.

00:44.070 --> 00:49.940
Mamorubekimono ga ima kokoni wa arukara
Because the ones you wish
to protect are right here.

00:49.940 --> 00:55.880
Namida mo gyutto dakishimete,
yasashisa de tsutsumikomi
Embrace their tears with kindness.

00:55.880 --> 01:01.560
Nagareru mizu no youni tsuyoku nare
Become strong like the formless water,

01:01.560 --> 01:07.550
omouyouni tsuyoku nare
Become as strong as you wish to be.

01:07.700 --> 01:13.170
Mou jibun ni obienaide
Stop being afraid of yourself.

01:13.170 --> 01:19.800
Sou mirai wo osorenaide
Do not fear the future.

01:37.430 --> 01:39.060
It's summer already...

01:39.060 --> 01:41.650
Summer is the season for love!

01:45.670 --> 01:47.830
The season for love...

01:49.340 --> 01:53.870
It would be great if I could make
some memories with Takagami...

01:54.080 --> 01:54.770
But!

01:54.840 --> 01:59.180
There's a blond girl named
Tenko Kugen-san staying with him.

01:59.180 --> 02:05.280
And there's Ko-san, a mysterious girl in a shrine
maiden outfit who calls Takagami "Noboru-sama."

02:06.250 --> 02:10.710
It's like Takagami's already
enjoying the season of love.

02:11.030 --> 02:15.760
I feel so dizzy.
Why am I worrying so much about it?

02:16.530 --> 02:19.660
I guess it's because I like Takagami...

02:20.340 --> 02:21.320
What does it mean to like him?

02:22.000 --> 02:24.970
Just because I like him, what's
waiting for me on the other side?

02:25.510 --> 02:29.380
Why must people fall in love?!

02:29.480 --> 02:30.380
Misaki?

02:31.210 --> 02:32.280
What's wrong?

02:32.280 --> 02:34.510
Nothing. Nothing at all.

02:40.890 --> 02:45.850
Our Fox Deity, Overindulges in Food

02:50.900 --> 02:53.530
I couldn't even say good morning to him...

02:53.640 --> 02:55.690
Why aren't we in the same class?

02:55.940 --> 02:59.630
I guess I could see him at the badminton club,
but I'd have to wait until after school.

03:01.040 --> 03:04.210
I think you have to approach happiness yourself!

03:05.480 --> 03:06.500
Megumi!

03:07.850 --> 03:09.210
Hi, Misaki.

03:16.060 --> 03:16.790
Later.

03:16.790 --> 03:17.620
Bye.

03:18.330 --> 03:22.200
Should I call you pitiful or just frustrating?

03:22.200 --> 03:23.320
What are you talking about?

03:23.670 --> 03:26.900
You can't hide it from me. I know
you have a thing for Takagami.

03:27.500 --> 03:29.870
I only came to see you, Megumi.

03:29.870 --> 03:31.870
Why don't you just go and tell him how you feel?

03:31.870 --> 03:34.170
I know I should, but...

03:35.210 --> 03:36.410
But...

03:36.410 --> 03:39.400
You never know how it'll end up...

03:39.710 --> 03:43.920
I actually think there's a higher
chance it won't end well.

03:43.920 --> 03:46.790
Sorry. I like Ku.

03:46.790 --> 03:47.720
Or...

03:47.720 --> 03:50.660
Sorry. I like Ko.

03:51.130 --> 03:54.620
If he says that to me, I don't know what I'll do!

04:02.170 --> 04:05.260
That's Miyabe Momiji-san from Class-2.

04:07.380 --> 04:09.780
The boys are all like this...

04:10.280 --> 04:13.810
She's graceful, classy, and innocent at heart.

04:13.980 --> 04:17.440
Miyabe-san is the most popular girl
among the boys here at Akagi High.

04:18.350 --> 04:20.840
Could it be that Takagami also...

04:23.730 --> 04:25.390
Their eyes met.

04:25.660 --> 04:27.860
What just happened?!

04:28.560 --> 04:30.590
In this case, I have to...

04:31.170 --> 04:32.390
Hold it right there!

04:33.740 --> 04:34.570
Me?

04:35.500 --> 04:36.470
And you are?

04:36.470 --> 04:38.410
Sakura Misaki from Class-4.

04:38.410 --> 04:39.700
So what do you want?

04:40.580 --> 04:43.840
I, uh... Nothing.

04:46.450 --> 04:47.610
Shiori-chan.

04:48.020 --> 04:50.310
I heard chorus practice is canceled.

04:50.990 --> 04:52.090
Oh, really?

04:52.090 --> 04:53.690
That's why she's here?

04:53.690 --> 04:58.060
Miyabe looks so much prettier
than when we were freshmen.

04:58.060 --> 04:58.680
Yeah.

04:59.990 --> 05:05.470
Miyabe-san always smells good.
Like flowers or herbs or something.

05:05.470 --> 05:08.300
Takagami is falling for her!

05:08.300 --> 05:12.940
Weren't Takagami and Miyabe-san in
the same class during freshmen year?!

05:12.940 --> 05:18.070
Maybe Takagami actually likes Miyabe
Momiji instead of those other two!

05:18.980 --> 05:20.910
She's hopeless...

05:37.600 --> 05:43.400
Megumi always tells me to stop
worrying and just charge at him...

05:45.940 --> 05:48.140
That's easier said than done.

05:49.180 --> 05:50.740
Ow...

05:51.280 --> 05:53.370
Ow... Sakura?!

05:54.220 --> 05:57.780
I charged at him... Wait, it's not
supposed to be done literally!

05:57.990 --> 06:00.780
I have to tell him how I feel!

06:05.360 --> 06:06.380
Where'd everyone go?

06:06.790 --> 06:08.490
They went off for some ramen.

06:09.630 --> 06:11.500
So I'm alone with Takagami...

06:12.330 --> 06:16.790
But how am I supposed to tell him my feelings?

06:17.070 --> 06:21.040
Do I do it wildly like when I hit a smash?
Or aim for accuracy like with a serve?

06:21.040 --> 06:22.210
Or how about...

06:22.210 --> 06:22.900
Sakura?

06:23.850 --> 06:25.780
You don't have to practice your
swing while we're walking...

06:25.780 --> 06:27.440
Oh, sorry.

06:27.820 --> 06:29.840
See you later. I want to go to the bookstore.

06:30.720 --> 06:32.710
Wait! I didn't charge into you yet!

06:33.650 --> 06:36.210
I mean, I want to go, too.

06:36.960 --> 06:39.360
There's this book I wanted to get!

06:50.200 --> 06:52.670
I wonder which one would be good for those two.

06:54.810 --> 06:56.500
Hey, Noboru!

06:57.110 --> 06:58.550
Hey!

06:58.550 --> 07:02.920
Her hair is shorter, but that's Tenko-san?!

07:02.920 --> 07:04.440
And Ko-san, too!

07:04.850 --> 07:06.920
They were going to meet up here?

07:06.920 --> 07:08.680
Was I just getting in their way?!

07:09.090 --> 07:13.290
But I thought you do dates with just two people.
Why are they both here?

07:13.290 --> 07:14.890
Is he two-timing them?! Will there be blood?!

07:15.360 --> 07:20.300
Will I get to see a merciless battle among
women unfold here at the bookstore?!

07:20.840 --> 07:22.740
What are you two doing here?

07:25.170 --> 07:26.670
Hey, stop!

07:26.670 --> 07:28.540
Yeah! Don't fight!

07:31.980 --> 07:34.050
It's so salty?! What is this?!

07:34.050 --> 07:35.220
Ritual purification salt.

07:35.220 --> 07:36.110
Salt?!

07:36.750 --> 07:40.120
I sensed there were some
zakki spirits lurking nearby.

07:40.420 --> 07:41.410
Zakki spirits?

07:41.920 --> 07:45.090
A type of yokai, but they do
not have any significant power.

07:45.730 --> 07:47.900
Sorry about that. You okay, Sakura?

07:47.900 --> 07:48.950
Y-Yeah.

07:50.100 --> 07:51.160
How could they?

07:52.330 --> 07:58.000
Simply drawing or reading these magical
symbols will have some sort of effect.

07:58.640 --> 08:00.940
Besides, this diagram is incorrect.

08:01.310 --> 08:05.150
This is what is causing a strange field to
be created, attracting these zakki spirits.

08:05.150 --> 08:07.050
I don't understand a thing you just said.

08:07.050 --> 08:11.640
Ko just has a thing for fengshui and stuff like that.

08:12.290 --> 08:13.650
Is something the matter?

08:17.190 --> 08:20.330
I-I'm sorry! We spilled some salt...

08:20.330 --> 08:21.120
No, I scattered it.

08:21.300 --> 08:23.000
Ko, shut it!

08:23.000 --> 08:25.630
Hey, buy me this!

08:25.630 --> 08:26.270
No!

08:26.270 --> 08:28.900
I want it!

08:28.900 --> 08:30.610
No means no!

08:30.610 --> 08:32.200
I said I want this!

08:33.670 --> 08:35.440
Sir...

08:37.580 --> 08:40.650
They ended up forcing me to pay for it.

08:40.650 --> 08:44.240
I can't sell torn books or salt-covered
books to a used book store.

08:44.550 --> 08:46.710
The family budget is gonna
take a huge hit this month.

08:47.050 --> 08:48.280
I'm sorry.

08:48.360 --> 08:49.950
It looks good.

08:53.690 --> 08:58.190
A mysterious girl of the shy and sweet variety...
Despite how she loves throwing salt around.

08:58.570 --> 08:59.830
On the other hand...

08:59.830 --> 09:03.360
We have the self-centered
tsundere. To top it off, a blond.

09:04.770 --> 09:07.370
Both kinds are really popular with the guys...

09:08.010 --> 09:10.140
Why did you even come in the first place?

09:10.140 --> 09:14.820
The Mamorime said she wanted to
learn how to cook and do chores.

09:14.820 --> 09:16.980
So she asked Toru where the bookstore was.

09:16.980 --> 09:19.850
Noboru, you have to make this for
me when we get home. Come on!

09:21.090 --> 09:25.930
At home... When did Takagami
get so popular with girls?!

09:25.930 --> 09:28.460
Wait, what kind of life does he live at home?!

09:28.460 --> 09:30.930
Does he get to sleep on her lap...

09:31.230 --> 09:33.530
Or they might bathe together...

09:33.600 --> 09:36.840
Or they have group make-out sessions?!

09:36.840 --> 09:38.670
- Cakes! Cakes!

09:38.670 --> 09:39.310
- No!
- Cakes! Cakes!

09:39.310 --> 09:40.970
I've never made a cake before.

09:42.040 --> 09:44.200
I'll make it for you!

09:44.950 --> 09:47.240
So can I go to your house?!

09:48.220 --> 09:51.670
Sakura-sama, are you good at cooking?

09:51.820 --> 09:54.340
Well... Sort of.

09:54.620 --> 09:58.590
Then would you please teach me how to cook?

09:58.590 --> 10:01.130
S-Sure, I don't mind...

10:01.130 --> 10:02.990
Can I?

10:04.130 --> 10:05.960
How about next Sunday?

10:06.370 --> 10:07.960
Sure!

10:08.270 --> 10:10.030
That sounds good.

10:10.610 --> 10:12.470
Thank you very much.

10:13.410 --> 10:17.310
Hooray! I don't know what just happened,
but now I can go visit Takagami's home!

10:32.890 --> 10:35.990
Which one should I wear?

10:37.700 --> 10:39.600
Misaki! I'm coming in.

10:42.140 --> 10:45.940
What is this? What are you
agonizing over in your panties?

10:45.940 --> 10:47.370
Sis...

10:47.840 --> 10:54.510
Which outfit would be easy to get around in but
still look cute, feminine, and unpretentious?

10:54.650 --> 10:55.850
Where are you going?

10:55.850 --> 10:57.750
Out to teach how to cook and bake a cake...

10:57.750 --> 11:00.250
But it's nothing but a front.

11:00.250 --> 11:01.950
What are you, some kind of spy?

11:03.820 --> 11:05.990
I guess that's not entirely wrong.

11:06.290 --> 11:10.560
I'm trying to find out what
Takagami is really thinking.

11:17.870 --> 11:21.900
Maybe Sis' recommendation was a bit too cute...

11:24.250 --> 11:25.950
Takagami

11:25.950 --> 11:30.820
Now I'm getting nervous. It's the first time
I've come to Takagami's home, after all.

11:30.820 --> 11:32.650
His home...

11:32.650 --> 11:35.460
Then his dad is here, too!

11:35.460 --> 11:37.460
How should I greet him?

11:37.460 --> 11:39.290
Good evening. Wait, it's still early in the day.

11:39.930 --> 11:42.730
Thank you for welcoming me into your
family... I'm getting way ahead of myself!

11:42.730 --> 11:46.500
Me and Takagami?! Marrying?!

11:47.900 --> 11:50.670
A-Are you the father?

11:50.670 --> 11:51.160
Excuse me?

11:51.410 --> 11:54.030
Hello, I'm Sakura Misaki!

11:54.280 --> 11:55.260
Uh-huh.

11:55.640 --> 11:58.750
Dad, she's a friend from the badminton club.

11:58.750 --> 11:59.840
Oh, welcome.

12:01.580 --> 12:03.070
Thank you.

12:05.820 --> 12:06.950
Come on in.

12:09.190 --> 12:11.020
So this is Takagami's house.

12:11.230 --> 12:14.420
Yay. This is one giant leap for me.

12:15.330 --> 12:17.820
Let me go get my brother.

12:19.730 --> 12:21.730
H-He's so cute!

12:22.500 --> 12:25.130
That's my brother and mother.

12:26.470 --> 12:30.480
Just seeing this photo makes the trip worthwhile...

12:30.480 --> 12:31.500
Cake.

12:32.750 --> 12:34.340
Chocolate cake!

12:34.780 --> 12:35.840
Welcome.

12:38.620 --> 12:39.350
Here you go.

12:42.020 --> 12:43.520
Oh, thank you.

12:43.520 --> 12:45.790
So these things will transform into a cake?

12:45.790 --> 12:46.560
Uh, yes.

12:48.630 --> 12:49.360
Welco...

12:51.730 --> 12:53.430
What happened?!

12:53.430 --> 12:54.590
It's so bitter...

12:55.700 --> 12:57.600
Tea is supposed to be bitter.

12:58.210 --> 13:00.570
Ko, that's stomach medicine!

13:00.940 --> 13:03.930
But it was green like tea...

13:04.310 --> 13:06.110
Cake! Cake!

13:09.620 --> 13:11.210
T-Takagami?!

13:12.220 --> 13:15.290
I-It's just that Ku let
something inappropriate show.

13:15.290 --> 13:16.820
Inappropriate?!

13:16.820 --> 13:18.090
Be careful with those!

13:18.730 --> 13:20.860
They're not inappropriate! They're magnificent!

13:20.860 --> 13:22.190
I'm offended!

13:24.060 --> 13:28.240
I guess he doesn't seem to
have the rosy life I imagined.

13:28.240 --> 13:32.300
It doesn't seem like the two of
them are Takagami's girlfriends.

13:38.050 --> 13:39.910
Now let's make some nikujaga!

13:40.110 --> 13:40.950
Yes.

13:40.950 --> 13:42.940
Hey, what about the cake, Sakura?

13:43.020 --> 13:45.010
We'll do that later.

13:45.590 --> 13:50.060
Wow, so we'll get some home
cooking and fresh-baked cake today.

13:50.060 --> 13:54.220
Looks like Ku-chan and Ko-chan
finally got a female friend.

13:58.570 --> 14:00.120
Here, have a taste.

14:00.370 --> 14:00.990
Sure.

14:03.070 --> 14:04.040
How is it?

14:06.070 --> 14:07.470
It's delicious.

14:08.780 --> 14:10.840
This smells good!

14:12.180 --> 14:13.950
Tenko-san! No!

14:13.950 --> 14:14.940
It's bitter!

14:28.100 --> 14:29.930
I love a nice hot bath.

14:37.770 --> 14:40.800
How did it end up like this?

14:45.010 --> 14:45.880
Still...

14:46.680 --> 14:50.280
Even from my point of view,
those two look really attractive...

14:50.280 --> 14:54.520
Takagami can see them come out
of the bath all steamy every day...

14:55.060 --> 15:00.020
Even if there's nothing between them now,
they might start bathing together someday!

15:01.800 --> 15:02.760
Hot!

15:03.660 --> 15:04.890
Geez!

15:05.030 --> 15:07.230
Even the nikujaga is covered with cocoa powder.

15:07.740 --> 15:11.170
Cocoa nikujaga. Sounds like a really novel dish.

15:11.740 --> 15:14.040
Takagami... I'm sorry.

15:14.040 --> 15:16.130
It's not your fault.

15:16.480 --> 15:17.940
Let's order some takeout for lunch.

15:18.110 --> 15:19.180
What about my cake?

15:19.180 --> 15:20.050
None for you!

15:20.050 --> 15:22.020
What?! Cake! Cake!

15:22.120 --> 15:23.450
I said no!

15:23.650 --> 15:25.690
Cake! Cake! Cake!

15:25.690 --> 15:26.890
U-Um...

15:26.890 --> 15:27.650
What?

15:27.790 --> 15:30.960
If you'd like, how about we go out for some cake?

15:30.960 --> 15:33.550
They're having a cake buffet
at the hotel near the station.

15:33.790 --> 15:35.200
Buffet?!

15:35.200 --> 15:36.730
It's all-you-can-eat.

15:36.730 --> 15:37.990
I'm going! I'm going!

15:38.830 --> 15:40.360
Can we, Takagami?

15:41.940 --> 15:42.660
It should be fine.

15:42.940 --> 15:44.870
You girls just go and have fun.

15:44.870 --> 15:48.240
Yay! I'm so glad I turned into a girl!

15:48.240 --> 15:48.830
What?

15:48.910 --> 15:52.140
Sh-She means she's glad she was born a girl.

15:52.410 --> 15:53.680
Oh.

15:53.680 --> 15:55.580
Would you like to come too, Ko-san?

15:57.820 --> 15:59.510
I would gladly go.

16:00.320 --> 16:01.790
Then it's settled.

16:10.900 --> 16:12.590
I get to eat all this?

16:12.900 --> 16:15.200
That's right. But there's a one hour limit.

16:15.370 --> 16:18.170
- Buffets are awesome!

16:18.170 --> 16:19.940
- The customers here seem to be mostly female.
- Buffets are awesome!

16:20.170 --> 16:22.730
Yeah. I come here with my
friends from time to time, too.

16:23.740 --> 16:24.770
Friends?

16:25.080 --> 16:28.010
I guess you and Tenko-san are my friends already.

16:31.390 --> 16:33.990
Did I say something weird?

16:33.990 --> 16:38.390
What kind of relationship do you
refer to when you say "friend?"

16:38.830 --> 16:44.890
We go out to play like we're doing now.
Or talk about our problems and worries and stuff...

16:45.570 --> 16:51.100
Going out to play or talking
about problems with you...

16:51.370 --> 16:56.780
What's going on?! Should I have said something
like we're not friends! We're after the same man!

16:57.110 --> 16:59.850
I'm sorry. This is the first time for me...

16:59.850 --> 17:01.040
What do you mean?

17:02.380 --> 17:03.650
Having a friend...

17:06.750 --> 17:07.860
She's cute!

17:07.860 --> 17:09.120
I mean, no!

17:09.590 --> 17:14.730
I asked the two of them out here so I can
let them know I have a thing for Takagami...

17:14.730 --> 17:17.460
...and maybe get them to cooperate with me.

17:18.970 --> 17:21.200
I have such dirty ulterior motives...

17:21.200 --> 17:23.230
I'm always only thinking about myself.

17:23.770 --> 17:25.300
Sakura-sama...

17:26.570 --> 17:32.380
If there is a problem troubling you,
would you talk to me about it?

17:32.750 --> 17:33.870
Ko-san...

17:35.180 --> 17:36.770
You can just call me Misaki.

17:37.580 --> 17:41.750
I'm sorry. I can't tell you
about my problem just yet.

17:43.360 --> 17:46.790
I understand. Misaki-sama.

17:48.900 --> 17:51.090
She's such a nice person...

17:51.730 --> 17:54.000
You guys better hurry or I'll eat all of it!

17:57.970 --> 18:00.100
I love buffets!

18:02.780 --> 18:03.710
What happened?

18:03.880 --> 18:08.480
Well, Tenko-sama is displaying
herself in an inappropriate manner.

18:08.480 --> 18:10.820
Takagami said something like that earlier.

18:10.820 --> 18:12.010
What is she doing?

18:12.350 --> 18:16.060
It's perky and fluffy and also quite magnificent.

18:16.060 --> 18:19.290
But it's not something to be shown in public.

18:19.290 --> 18:23.200
She normally keeps them hidden,
but when she gets excited...

18:23.200 --> 18:25.890
Okay. You don't have to say any more...

18:26.200 --> 18:29.900
Tenko-san strips down whenever she gets excited...

18:29.900 --> 18:31.870
I knew I could expect that from a foreign student!

18:32.640 --> 18:35.700
Wait, that's not the point here!

18:38.180 --> 18:39.410
I'll be going now.

18:39.850 --> 18:41.220
Thanks, Sakura.

18:41.220 --> 18:45.850
Tell me if some bad yokai possesses you
or anything. I'll come to help right away!

18:45.850 --> 18:47.050
S-Sure.

18:49.160 --> 18:51.920
I made some slightly weird friends today.

18:52.630 --> 18:53.350
Bye.

18:53.560 --> 18:55.460
Ku-chan! Ko-chan!

18:57.930 --> 18:59.870
Wh-Wh-What?!

18:59.870 --> 19:01.700
Th-The books!

19:01.800 --> 19:03.900
Ew! What are those?!

19:04.270 --> 19:05.110
Zakki spirits...

19:05.110 --> 19:06.410
What? Zakki spirits?

19:06.410 --> 19:07.960
They followed us from the bookstore.

19:08.080 --> 19:10.370
What? Really?

19:10.440 --> 19:13.080
My scattering of the salt didn't finish them off.

19:13.080 --> 19:15.880
It was waiting for us to get away from Toru!

19:19.350 --> 19:22.220
Metal overcomes wood!

19:26.860 --> 19:28.950
Seems even the zakki spirits know that.

19:30.330 --> 19:35.940
It's perky and fluffy and also magnificent,
but not something that should be shown in public...

19:35.940 --> 19:37.730
A fox!

19:45.510 --> 19:48.320
These bugs aren't even worth asking their names.

19:48.320 --> 19:49.410
Begone!

19:55.660 --> 19:57.390
I'm going to have to erase your memory.

19:57.960 --> 20:00.260
You didn't see anything...

20:01.030 --> 20:03.960
I didn't see anything...

20:04.300 --> 20:05.170
Good!

20:05.170 --> 20:06.170
Oh, yeah!

20:06.170 --> 20:10.800
I want to ask Tenko-san to go
with me to the cake buffet again.

20:10.970 --> 20:12.140
- Hey!
- Tenko-sama!

20:12.140 --> 20:14.310
Oh, come on. This should be all right!

20:14.310 --> 20:15.580
No, it is not.

20:15.580 --> 20:18.100
Please do not plant strange
ideas into Misaki-sama's mind.

20:18.550 --> 20:20.810
Don't you want to go there again?

20:23.250 --> 20:24.790
Huh, I...

20:24.790 --> 20:26.790
What was I doing?

20:26.790 --> 20:29.190
You probably got a little dizzy from the heat.

20:29.460 --> 20:30.590
Dizzy...

20:30.590 --> 20:32.530
Are you okay, Sakura?

20:33.230 --> 20:35.600
What?! Takagami?!

20:35.600 --> 20:37.860
I got worried, so I came to see you.

20:38.930 --> 20:44.740
Takagami was worried about me?!
I woke up in his arms?!

20:44.740 --> 20:47.500
No way! It's like Snow White or Cinderella!

20:48.410 --> 20:50.900
I'm like a princess right now!

20:52.980 --> 20:55.180
Hey, the bus is here.

20:55.920 --> 20:58.020
I hope you'll come again to make the nikujaga.

20:58.020 --> 20:59.450
We will be waiting.

20:59.450 --> 21:01.110
Bye!

21:01.920 --> 21:03.750
Bye-bye!

21:05.390 --> 21:07.360
We should get going, too.

21:18.370 --> 21:19.400
In the end...

21:19.610 --> 21:24.940
I didn't get to find out what Takagami thought
of me, but I guess it's better if I left it at that.

21:25.210 --> 21:27.840
But something feels...

21:36.720 --> 21:43.190
sora no hate ga tsunagaru basho wo
Where the horizon meets the earth,

21:43.660 --> 21:50.870
no ni saku hana wa mada kitto shiranai
The flower growing in the wild remains unaware.

21:52.240 --> 21:58.740
Kokoyori ii sekai ga aruto
While thinking that there
is a world better than this.

21:58.880 --> 22:06.510
Kokoro wa itsumo hane wo hirogetagaru
They always desire to spread
the wings of their hearts.

22:07.420 --> 22:14.450
Yume dakede owarasenai
Don't let it end as just a dream,

22:15.060 --> 22:21.560
chansu ga aru hazusa
There's always a chance.

22:21.770 --> 22:29.210
Daijoubu bokura wa hitori janai
It's all right. We are not alone.

22:29.210 --> 22:36.820
Kaze ga nanika wo iouto shiteru
The winds are telling us something.

22:36.820 --> 22:44.490
Daijoubu kanarazu umaku yareru
It's all right. You can do it.

22:44.490 --> 22:55.730
Omoi wa itsuka jibun wo kaeru michi ni naru
Those dreams are a path you'll change yourself.

22:59.940 --> 23:03.310
I want to take Tenko-san
out to the cake buffet again.

23:04.710 --> 23:08.010
It's because Ku put some
weird hypnosis on Sakura...

23:08.520 --> 23:12.580
Why am I asking Tenko-san out here?! Why?!

23:12.850 --> 23:17.150
I-Is it because I like her?!
Did I fall in love with Tenko-san?!

23:17.720 --> 23:19.120
No way!

23:20.090 --> 23:22.620
Buffet! Buffet!

23:25.000 --> 23:25.300
Next Time

23:25.300 --> 23:30.070
Next Time
This time, a pair of foxes that were chased
out of their homes came to us for help.

23:30.070 --> 23:34.370
Next Time
Along came a suspicious man in a
raincoat, but Ko-chan destroyed him!

23:34.370 --> 23:34.840
Next Time
Next time, "Our Fox Deity, Embraces a Fox Cub."

23:34.840 --> 23:36.780
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Embraces a Fox Cub
Next time, "Our Fox Deity, Embraces a Fox Cub."

23:36.780 --> 23:36.810
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Embraces a Fox Cub

23:36.810 --> 23:39.510
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Embraces a Fox Cub
Even yokai have their own personal problems.

23:39.510 --> 23:39.980
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Embraces a Fox Cub
